      "content": "hey can u help me draft a quick linkedin post for a startup founder? basically they just launched a new fintech app but they're struggling with all the crazy compliance and regulatory hurdles in the industry right now. i want it to sound a bit frustrated—like, how are small companies supposed to innovate when they're stuck dealing with all this endless red tape?",
