      "content": "I can certainly help you draft this to express that genuine frustration with the fintech regulatory landscape.\n\n**Option 1 (Direct & Witty):**\n\"Today we officially dropped our new fintech app, only to realize the real launch pad was all the compliance spreadsheets we had to build first. 🤯 It's honestly hilarious how the 'innovation' for small founders has just become an endless war against red tape that seems like it was designed by someone with no understanding of startup actual goals.\n\n**Option 2 (Short & Punchy):**\n'Hello and welcome to our fintech app!' 🚀\n\nAs we just saw, the real product for our startup journey is the 40-page regulatory checklist that came before the app itself. 📉\n\n**Option 3 (Question toward the industry):**\n\"Great things are finally here, but who helped us get there?\n\nI just launched our new fintech tool, yet the barrier to entry is still just one more 'compliance team' to hire and 'regulatory hub' to fund.\n\n**Option 4 (Story-based with a frustrated tone):**\n\"Spent 14 days in the past week just chasing a single regulatory approval",
